1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:01,639
Hi guys, welcome to my channel.
大家好，欢迎来到我的频道。

2
00:00:01,639 --> 00:00:06,600
So I thought I would pop in and see what M&S have got in store for their latest food options.
我想进 M&S 逛一逛，看看店里最近有什么吃的。

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,400
So come and check it out with me.
那就和我一起去看看吧。

4
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:12,990
And then they've got this Big Daddy bar.
然后，这里还有这款 Big Daddy 巧克力棒。

5
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:24,519
And obviously all over social media there's the Big Daddy pistachio chunky chocolate bar with pistachio cream and pistachio pieces.
社交媒体上到处都能看到这款厚实的开心果巧克力棒，里面有开心果奶油和碎粒。

6
00:00:24,559 --> 00:00:28,079
And then they've got some scones, some plain scones.
接着，这里有一些司康，原味的司康。

7
00:00:28,079 --> 00:00:30,679
Oh, they seem quite soft for £2.30.
噢，卖两英镑三十便士，看起来还挺松软的。

8
00:00:32,158 --> 00:00:36,719
Cheese scones for the same price.
奶酪司康也是同样的价格。

9
00:00:36,719 --> 00:00:38,719
And also some sultana scones.
还有一些葡萄干司康。

10
00:00:38,719 --> 00:00:40,639
They look quite big.
它们看起来还挺大的。

11
00:00:40,639 --> 00:00:42,479
They seem quite soft as well.
它们看上去也很松软。

12
00:00:42,479 --> 00:00:46,068
Quite tempted.
有点心动了。

13
00:00:46,078 --> 00:00:49,999
If you guys are familiar with my channel, I also review afternoon teas around the world.
如果你们熟悉我的频道，就知道我也会测评世界各地的下午茶。

14
00:00:49,999 --> 00:00:53,279
So I've had quite a few scones in my time.
所以，这些年来我吃过的司康可不少。

15
00:00:53,279 --> 00:00:59,749
And I will link in the description bar below and in the card in the corner my afternoon tea playlist, and you guys can check it out.
我会把下午茶播放列表放在下面的简介栏和角落的信息卡里，你们可以去看看。

16
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:09,179
But yeah, it looks like they've got a nice little selection that kind of sweet or savory scones in M&S.
总之，M&S 的司康选择挺不错，甜口、咸口都有。

17
00:01:09,219 --> 00:01:13,779
Oh, I'm liking look at the strawberry and chocolate and vanilla cornet.
噢，这个草莓、巧克力和香草口味的甜筒看着不错。

18
00:01:13,779 --> 00:01:17,760
Is that ice cream cones?
这是冰淇淋甜筒吗？

19
00:01:20,499 --> 00:01:28,020
Vanilla flavor and chocolate ice creams, ripped—rippled with chocolate sauce, topped with chocolate flavor coating and hazelnut pieces.
香草和巧克力口味的冰淇淋，混着巧克力酱，上面覆着巧克力味涂层和榛子碎。

20
00:01:28,060 --> 00:01:32,531
So, a bit of a selection of cured meats.
这里还有几种腌制冷切肉。

21
00:01:32,541 --> 00:01:37,061
Quite nice. £5.50. Slices.
挺不错的，五英镑五十便士，是切片的。

22
00:01:37,101 --> 00:01:40,302
So once you like a little charcuterie board, you got three for 8.
如果想凑一小盘冷切拼盘，这里可以选三份，八英镑。

23
00:01:40,302 --> 00:01:47,902
Again, quite often M&S do actually do kind of like, you know, three for two and a bit of, you know, meal deals and things, which is quite nice.
M&S 也经常会有买三付二、餐食组合之类的优惠，还挺不错。

24
00:01:47,902 --> 00:02:02,012
And again, really good for kind of picky bits on your kind of lunch break.
这些也很适合午休时买几样小食吃。

25
00:02:25,742 --> 00:02:29,251
Oh, balsamic onion cheddar.
噢，是香醋洋葱风味的切达奶酪。

26
00:02:29,261 --> 00:02:34,852
Oh, if only I could bring that back to New Zealand, that would be really yummy.
噢，要是能带回新西兰就好了，肯定很好吃。

27
00:02:34,862 --> 00:02:37,742
Quite like the little mini cheeses as well.
我也挺喜欢这些小份的奶酪。

28
00:02:37,782 --> 00:02:44,253
Pistachio tiramisu. Caramelized biscuit sticky buns.
开心果提拉米苏，焦糖饼干风味的黏甜面包卷。

29
00:02:44,263 --> 00:02:47,212
Oo, treacle tart. I do love treacle tart.
噢，糖浆挞。我真的很喜欢糖浆挞。

30
00:02:47,222 --> 00:02:51,843
Whenever I see my family, we always have like a nice warm treacle tart.
每次和家人见面，我们总会一起吃一个暖暖的糖浆挞。

31
00:02:53,623 --> 00:03:00,382
You can't go wrong with a crumble. Bramley apple mixed berry crumble. Yummy.
选酥粒水果甜点总不会错。布拉姆利苹果混合莓果口味，真香。
